  "_doc": "One row per weapon; _moves holds every attack a weapon can name. Weapon: family (the skill it trains: sword, knife, spear, staff, axe, bow, thrown, hand), hands, reach (m), dmg (a plain cut at ordinary might), speed (above 1 is quicker), weight (multiplies stamina cost), guard (share of a frontal blow it stops; 0 cannot guard). light = the chain a tapped attack walks through; heavy = hold and release; low = attack from a duck. throw = it can be thrown: dmg, speed m/s, gravity, range, ammo (how many are carried). shot = it shoots: draw (s to full draw), dmg, speed, gravity, range, ammo. only/never = classes that may or may not carry it. earned = not offered at creation. Move: wind (s before it lands), recover (s after), arc (half-angle in degrees), reach (multiplier), dmg (multiplier), cost (stamina), hits (how many bodies one blow can strike), height (high | mid | low), lunge (m carried forward), on_hit (stagger s, down s, push m/s), clip (animation), at (share of the clip at which the blow lands), missile (true: it launches the weapon's throw or shot instead of striking).",
